{"id":"10.3.4.3","doc":"T","title":"Flash Voltage Regulator","words":229,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ESP32-S3's built-in flash voltage regulator can supply a voltage of "},{"t":"num","v":"3.3 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":" or "},{"t":"num","v":"1.8 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":" to other components outside of digital and RTC, such as flash."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For the architecture of the ESP32-S3 flash voltage regulator, see Figure 10.3-7."}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-10_3-7.png","alt":"Figure 10.3-7. Flash Voltage Regulator","caption":"Figure 10.3-7. Flash Voltage Regulator"},{"t":"list","ordered":true,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure "},{"t":"reg","v":"XPD_SDIO_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" to select power source to components outside of the digital and RTC:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"1: the voltage regulator outputs a voltage of "},{"t":"num","v":"3.3 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":" or "},{"t":"num","v":"1.8 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":";"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0: the voltage regulator outputs high-impedance."}]},{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In this case, the voltage is provided by the external power supply."}]}]}]]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Configure SDIO_TIEH to choose between "},{"t":"num","v":"3.3 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":" or "},{"t":"num","v":"1.8 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":":"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"1: the voltage regulator shorts pin "},{"t":"field","v":"VDD_SPI"},{"t":"text","v":" to pin "},{"t":"field","v":"VDD3P3_RTC"},{"t":"text","v":", and outputs a voltage of "},{"t":"num","v":"3.3 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":", which is the voltage of pin "},{"t":"field","v":"VDD3P3_RTC"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0: the voltage regulator outputs the reference voltage VREF, which is typically "},{"t":"num","v":"1.8 V","k":"voltage"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The signals mentioned above can be configured as below:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The configuration of "},{"t":"reg","v":"XPD_SDIO_REG"},{"t":"text","v":":"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":12,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When the chip is in active mode, "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_SDIO_FORCE"},{"t":"text","v":" == 0 and "},{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_VDD_SPI_FORCE"},{"t":"text","v":" == 1, the "},{"t":"reg","v":"XPD_SDIO_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" voltage is defined by "},{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_VDD_SPI_XPD"},{"t":"text","v":";"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":13,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When the chip is in sleep modes and "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_SDIO_REG_PD_EN"},{"t":"text","v":" == 1, "},{"t":"reg","v":"XPD_SDIO_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" is 0;"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":14,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_SDIO_FORCE"},{"t":"text","v":" == 1, "},{"t":"reg","v":"XPD_SDIO_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" is defined by "},{"t":"reg","v":"RTC_CNTL_XPD_SDIO_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":15,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The configuration of SDIO_TIEH:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"When "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_SDIO_FORCE"},{"t":"text","v":" == 0 and "},{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_VDD_SPI_FORCE"},{"t":"text","v":" == 1, SDIO_TIEH = "},{"t":"field","v":"EFUSE_VDD_SPI_TIEH"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":17,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Otherwise, SDIO_TIEH = "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_SDIO_TIEH"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]]}]]}]}